  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Experience a trampoline-like bounce with the ASICS NOVABLAST 6. Engineered for energy return, these running sneakers feature a Flyte Foam Turbo midsole and a trampoline-inspired pod for ultimate responsiveness. The updated woven upper offers a secure, breathable fit while the ASICSGRIP rubber outsole ensures you stay grounded with superior traction. Transform your daily miles into a high-energy ride with ASICS.<br><ul><li>Engineered woven upper provides a breathable and secure fit</li><li>Flyte Foam Turbo midsole delivers lightweight and springy cushioning</li><li>FF TURBO SQUARED trampoline pod increases responsiveness</li><li>ASICSGRIP rubber in the forefoot offers enhanced traction</li><li>Rubber outsole provides durability and grip on various surfaces</li></ul><br><b>Material & Care</b><br><ul><li>Fabric and foam upper</li><li>Rubber outsole</li></ul><br><b>Size & Fit</b><br><ul><li>Activewear silhouette with a round toe for natural movement</li><li>Lace up closure ensures a customized and snug fit</li></ul></p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® Novablast 6 - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Black</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium uppe